{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act48side_level_act48side_06_beg","storyGroup":"act48side","storySort":13,"storyDependence":"act48side_level_act48side_05_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"ME-6","storyName":"旧日诗篇","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"缇缇与帕拉斯辞行。在狱中，赞索斯遇见了一位愤世嫉俗的老人。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act48side/level_act48side_06_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act48side_06","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["帕拉斯","缇缇","赫卡德墨","？？？","卡珊卓拉","莱娜","吕刻伊昂","乞丐？","赞索斯","米奥"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c6/Avg_bg_69_g9_templetheater_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"……","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"天色晚了，帕拉斯，该分头准备了。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇，你真的想好了要这么做？","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"是的。自从贝赫努先生知道我们护送的文物是仿制品后，他就把竖琴交给了随行护卫看守，不让我靠近一步。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"今晚，他一定会派人加紧巡逻，以防出现任何意外，但到了明天的交换仪式，就不一样了。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"他必须让竖琴暴露在公共场所，这样我们才能有机会……","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f9/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"没错。","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"可是然后呢？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"然后？萨尔贡官方估计会对整桩事件进行形式化的公开道歉，私下会再派外交官与里底娅理事官沟通。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"表面上是萨尔贡使节携米诺斯国宝逃亡，实际上两国的相关负责人都会知道，丢失的只是一件仿制品而已。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#20$1","focus":"l","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"我问的不是这个，缇缇，我只想知道你会怎么样。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我？","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我会带着假琴和米奥，从古道离开。米纳特哈玛仪是不能回了，赫里帕夏的卫兵肯定会满城追捕我。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"真要被逮到了，无论是贝赫努先生还是赫里帕夏都有可能会消除对己方不利的证据，并把过错推到米诺斯方。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"只有我一直逃，萨尔贡那些位高权重的贵族才不敢擅自给这桩“偷窃案”定性。我带走的是假琴，也是真相。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"缇缇……","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fa/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"好啦，不要劝我了。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"如果有更好的方法，我也不想带着一把又大又重的琴环游泰拉啊。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"回去吧，帕拉斯，让我一个人待一会，我们明天早上再见。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avgnew_482_pallas_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帕拉斯","text":"好……","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avgnew_482_pallas_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":52},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"1.5","focus":"l","id":54},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":58},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":59},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":60},{"type":"charslot","id":61},{"type":"gridbg","imagegroup":"38_g21_skystarry_L1/38_g21_skystarry_r1/38_g21_skystarry_L2/38_g21_skystarry_r2","solidwidth":"1280/1280/1280/1280","solidheight":"720/720/720/720","x":"-640","fadetime":"0","id":62},{"type":"largebgtween","duration":"60","yFrom":"360","yTo":"720","block":"false","id":63},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.6","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"subtitle","text":"缇缇靠在广场观众席的椅背上抬头看。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":66},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在米诺斯，夜空总是晴朗通透，深得观星爱好者青睐。也正因这得天独厚的优势，自古以来米诺斯人都会将英雄与星辰的位置对应。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"23","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":67},{"type":"subtitle","text":"很小的时候，缇缇的父亲会一边望着星空，一边跟她讲英雄的故事。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"23","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":68},{"type":"subtitle","text":"有些能从书里找到，而没有出处的那些，它们或许是这个在功业上毫无建树、单单爱好文学的父亲胡编乱造的。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"23","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":69},{"type":"subtitle","text":"尽管后来病痛过早地将他带离人世，但缇缇现在还能清晰地记起父亲讲述的每一个故事。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"23","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":70},{"type":"subtitle","text":"在那些故事里，在米诺斯的故事里，会不会存在着一位带着假琴逃亡的英雄？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"23","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":71},{"type":"subtitle","text":"千万星辰沉默地在夜空中闪烁，缇缇没有找到答案。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"23","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":72},{"type":"subtitle","id":73},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":74},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":75},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":76},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":77},{"type":"charslot","id":78},{"type":"gridbg","id":79},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":80},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0a/Avg_bg_69_g13_generalroom_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":81},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":82},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":83},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":84,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","volume":"1","id":85},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":86},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"都这么晚了，早过了我的下班时间，有什么事明天上班再说——","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#9$1","focus":"n","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"理事官的执笔人先生，是我。","id":90},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","volume":"1","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":96},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"实在抱歉，我知道现在是您的休息时间。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"呃……您深夜造访所为何事？","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"我想问您，对于赞索斯师徒的盗窃案，里底娅理事官有没有跟您说过什么？","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"早些时候我造访理事官办公室与里底娅小姐商议戏剧仪式的剧目，提到前几天发生的那桩案件时，她态度模糊。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":105},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"啊，里底娅理事官想必有自己的考量。明天就是文物交换仪式，她不仅需要处理流程问题，还要应付萨尔贡使节团。","id":106,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"这正是我担心的。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"如果萨尔贡使节团以影响两国信任关系为由，要求对案件重新定性，负责外交事宜的里底娅理事官几乎无法拒绝。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"商谈的时候，我能看出她的神情有些紧张，一旁的办公桌上堆放着米诺斯法律大全和事件调查报告。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"她很有可能已经受到使节的胁迫。这样一来赞索斯师徒的罪名只会更重，而且……","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"而且？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"如果不是因为您感染矿石病的同窗危在旦夕，我想您家的沙发扶手后面，应该也不会有一条沃尔珀的尾巴。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"……","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"……","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":121},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"终于见面了，罗德岛办事处的负责人，莱娜小姐。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":124},{"type":"charslot","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":126},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":127},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"您好，卡珊卓拉小姐……","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"赞索斯和吕刻伊昂是莱娜小姐的病人，她只是想给狱中的两人送药，所以才找我帮忙。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"找您帮忙？如果只是普通监管所，莱娜小姐想要为犯人寄送药物并不困难。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1c/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"看来我的猜测并无太大差错，里底娅理事官为了满足萨尔贡使节的要求，确实准备重判，很有可能赞索斯师徒现在已经被投入死牢。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"我从未想到恩底弥翁神殿专司解梦的卡珊卓拉祭司，竟然如此擅长推理……","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"可是赫卡德墨先生您应该知道，哪怕是以理事官执笔人的身份，也无法探视死牢中的囚犯。","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"除非您动了极为危险的念头，比如说——","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"劫狱。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b6/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"……","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"我不能让吕刻伊昂他们因为矿石病急性发作死在牢里。他们确实做了错事，但判罚太重。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐，今天晚上您没有拜访过我的住处，也从来不知道盗窃案重判一事……","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"能否请您帮我们隐瞒？如果众英雄正在天穹注视我们，他们也不会坐视如此不合理的事情发生。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"莱娜小姐也是为了救人？","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ac/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"是。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#18$2","focus":"m","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"我要救我的病人，也要“救”我的妹妹。我明白她在理事官的位置上有抱负，也有苦衷，但她不能一错再错……","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/87/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-18$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"明天的交换仪式会吸引很多民众的目光，我已经想办法通过私人关系拿到了监狱的图纸，规划好了路线。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2070_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赫卡德墨","text":"只要把他们带出来，甚至只是给他们扎一针急性感染抑制剂都好……","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e2/Avg_avg_npc_2070_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"光有路线规划还不够，您需要人手帮您在理事官办公室和死牢这两处争取时间。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1022_flwr2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莱娜","text":"我会去找里底娅，至于狱警那里……","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/47/Avg_avg_1022_flwr2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"我可以帮你们。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":169},{"type":"charslot","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":171},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3a/Avg_bg_58_g14_yanprison.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":174},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"老先生，您说没有东西是完完全全属于米诺斯人自己的……怎么可能？","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a1/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"呵，我们放牧用的驮兽，见过吧？","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"罩在那些大脑袋上，用来控制视野的头巾和面罩，是不是来自萨尔贡？","id":179,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":180},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"啊，您对那些头巾的象征义有所不知，那其实是——","id":181,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":182},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"哈哈，别跟我说什么“这是用来影射侵占时期萨尔贡人逼迫我们穿戴头巾”。","id":183,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"讥讽和歌颂有什么区别，不都是他们在米诺斯文化里留下的痕迹？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"这怎么能混为一谈……","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"不服气？那再说说我们脚下的这片土地。","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"百余年前，米诺斯是扎根土壤，依傍天然河流的乐土，现在呢？","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"“对岸女王”玛拉帕夏募集萨尔贡和米诺斯的工程师，还有无数劳力，将三座城邦搬到钢铁履带之上，雅赛努斯城早已驶离了它的原址。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"老先生，您明显在偷换概念，哪怕没有萨尔贡人，我们迟早也会把自己的城邦搬上移动地块，这只是科技发展的必然趋势……","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"好，说得好！小伙子在题罗斯神殿待过吧？不过啊，你忽略了一点——哪怕就是现在，你与我争辩时使用的语言都是“混血儿”。","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"传统米诺斯语在萨尔贡侵占期间早已流失，那些祭司苦思冥想拼凑成的现代米诺斯语中，你猜会有多少词来自你们仇视的国家？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"你——","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2c/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"够了！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2069_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"吕刻伊昂","text":"……","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/55/Avg_avg_npc_2069_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#3$2","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"你没有听懂老先生的意思，吕刻伊昂。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"战争的痕迹无法消弭，一份停战协议不代表一切都过去了，我们无法为自己心中的米诺斯奋斗，因为它早就不存在了。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"戴头盔的，你倒是有点意思。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":209},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"按照年龄推算，您不可能是侵占时期的亲历者，但刚刚您说的话透露出您对侵占时期十分了解……","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5a/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"不要把宝贵的时间用在揣测陌生人的来历上。","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"我只是一个死在街上跟死在狱里并无区别的流浪汉，曾经有个还算凑合的儿子，但他被梦拐跑了。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"梦？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2076_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"九年前的一个早晨，他从自己的房间跑出来，把我从宿醉中摇醒，说他梦到了一条河，他该启程了。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"一条染血的河，呵，就算不拜访恩底弥翁神殿的祭司，我也能解读出它的意思。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乞丐？","text":"那小子不是想摆脱我，就是想上战场想疯了。他忘了我们家祖辈经历过什么，也忘了他爹是怎么会变成酗酒好赌的废人的。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/fc/Avg_avg_npc_2076_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"神谕……染血的河……","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4166_varkis_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"赞索斯","text":"……您是伊萨科斯的父亲？","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/03/Avg_avg_4166_varkis_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":231},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_69_g6_athenusalley_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","id":233},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":235},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$warm_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_warm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":236,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","channel":"1","id":237},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"1","fadetime":"1.5","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#11$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"……","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"缇缇！怎么这么晚才回来，我还以为你已经“畏罪潜逃”了呢。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我们可能真得畏罪潜逃啦，米奥。","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"什么？！你在外面转悠了那么长时间就想出来这么个办法，还要我陪你一起受苦？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#14$1","focus":"r","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"带着假琴远走他乡，把所有错归结为一次个人的“偷窃行为”，这是我能想到的最好的解决方法了。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/19/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"你想的根本不是最好的解决方法，而是最“梅捷缇克缇”的解决方法！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"啊？","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"三周前使节团离开萨尔贡，你说自己是为了体验克瑞斯拉初到雅赛努斯的路线，所以宁愿辛苦也要沿古道走。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"但你明明是看出了贝赫努带着手下的护卫挤对你，为了不闹出矛盾，又担心他们对文物照顾不周，所以才搬着又大又沉的竖琴独自离开。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"还有，几个月前在米纳特哈玛仪，为了帮佩佩那个丫头解围，你往自己身上倒了整整一瓶葡萄酒。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"我们认识之后，你一直跟我抱怨这件事，你说博物馆馆长的工资根本不高，衣物干洗费贵得要死。","id":260,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"但你从没有说佩佩一句不是，反而觉得那是自己作为朋友应该做的。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d5/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"如果你想出来的解决方法最后都会委屈自己，那还不如甩手不干来得好呢！","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"噗……","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"米奥","text":"笑什么！","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f0/Avg_avg_npc_1482_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":268},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"没什么，只是我听你这么说了之后，更觉得自己的做法没有错。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"就像赞索斯和吕刻伊昂先生，他们不想让一件本该归还米诺斯的文物变成某种外交筹码，所以决定盗琴，并承担一切后果。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"我并不了解他们真正的想法，但我认为他们的事迹同样可以写进英雄故事。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"现在，我只是一个“效仿者”。我不敢说自己理解了何为英雄气概，但我想创造自己的故事——","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"哪怕我算不上“英雄”，哪怕故事的主人公只能逃亡。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#5$1","focus":"n","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#2$1","focus":"n","id":276},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"很意外，梅捷缇克缇小姐，您能有这样的觉悟……","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":278},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"卡珊卓拉小姐？","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":282},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","id":283},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"您不责怪盗琴的赞索斯师徒？要是没有那桩事故，您本可以顺利完成文物交换，哪怕您手中的是一把假琴。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7a/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1482_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":288},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"怎么会怪他们？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c3/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"虽然我猜贝赫努先生为了先发制人，一定会向里底娅理事官施压，让赞索斯先生他们受到不公正的判决……但他们才是让真相彰显的人。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/aa/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"要是我带走假琴能转移矛盾的焦点，让赞索斯和吕刻伊昂先生脱困，那也就值得了……","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ef/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":295},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4056_titi_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"缇缇","text":"等等，卡珊卓拉小姐，您怎么知道萨尔贡使节团带来的琴是仿制品？","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_4056_titi_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"……","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2068_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡珊卓拉","text":"请跟我来，梅捷缇克缇小姐。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_npc_2068_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":305},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":306},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":307},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":308},{"type":"image","id":309},{"type":"charslot","id":310}],"characters":["帕拉斯","缇缇","赫卡德墨","？？？","卡珊卓拉","莱娜","吕刻伊昂","乞丐？","赞索斯","米奥"]}